# card-save: saves a game to the memory card (default cards: a blank formatted card in slot 1, slot
# 2 empty). The pause-retire route to the retire (tick 3420); the continue countdown runs out, game
# over, and the save screen (tick 4916). Cross: the card in slot 1 holds no save file, so the save
# starts from the defaults and shows three empty slots; Down, Up, Circle backs out to the options.
# Down (slot 2), Cross: no card, the message for 120 ticks. Up (slot 1), Cross, Down (save slot 2),
# Cross: the file is created and the game saved in it; Puzzle Mode exits.
